<body>
    <h1>Power BI</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"ae416f63b88e">The current reporting solution utilize=
s <strong>Power BI</strong> to generate custom reports by integrating data =
from <strong>Dynamics 365</strong> and <strong>HelixDB</strong>. Data from =
both source systems is combined within the reporting layer to support cross=
-platform analytics, operational reporting, and business insights.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1c6a310ff4d4"><strong>Power BI Repo:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7a06fdb8d0fd"><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearanc=
e=3D"inline" href=3D"https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20=
Integration/_git/WRB%20-%20PowerBi" local-id=3D"139f4956-8121-4d40-8190-9b4=
2f504d6db" rel=3D"nofollow">https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%2=
0CRM%20Integration/_git/WRB%20-%20PowerBi</a></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"33b7ee9c1d61" id=3D"PowerBI-Architecture:">Architecture:</h=
4>
